    "id": "e2df35be81ae8819",
    "text": "Laser Module - Carvera (2.5w) and Carvera Air (5w)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "a3c74848466d2ba7",
    "text": "Note that these settings are estimates as specific material properties can vary based on material color and manufacturer. Always take extreme care when testing laser settings, perform test cuts in a well ventilated space, always use protective eyewear, and never leave the laser unattended. Also ensure that the materials being cut and engraved are compatible with laser processing, and if not, utilize the milling spindle instead.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "9354f2dc3d69b7c5",
    "text": "For additional information and support, check out our",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
