    "id": "9297a89c2a5eadad",
    "text": "Thread Milling Parameters - 3.175mm (1/8\") Shank Diameter Bits",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "585999cfae381e05",
    "text": "Both the Carvera and Carvera Air desktop CNC's can be used to machine threads for the holes in your parts using thread milling bits, and thread milling operations. You can find Thread milling bits in our",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "824d80d71985f082",
    "text": "store",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "a820ae1cb851d88a",
    "text": ", and the default feed and speed parameters for these bits are pre-loaded in",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "0fc2b4c63f6d4890",
    "text": ". Please also refer to the table below as a general guideline to assist as you created threaded holes using your CNC's.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "927c084e678640ac",
    "text": "Thread Milling Parameters",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "2ef9c699245c3419",
    "text": "Speed & Feed Parameters",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "316339c60c32a361",
    "text": "Nominal Size",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "9841d0980c0fc942",
    "text": "Thread Pitch",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "979d31145dec3c4a",
    "text": "Tapping Drill Size",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "b50108c461d7dbba",
    "text": "Woods & Plastics",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/speeds-and-feeds"
  },
  {
    "id": "946cf5f592c018eb",
