  },
  {
    "id": "9ccaa35947f47dae",
    "text": "Supported Codes",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "af5ca955bd4beb7c",
    "text": "The Carvera firmware is based on Smoothieware, which support both CNC and 3d printing, we only list Carvera Desktop CNC related codes below, check",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "f41fba482905e3d9",
    "text": "for the original code support by Smoothieware.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "6ef84e472a05a727",
    "text": "G Codes",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "340f463033e0fd5d",
    "text": "Code",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "1cfa117418e67ed4",
    "text": "Code_Example",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "8d71dbe6de622437",
    "text": "Move to the given coordinates. It is used to go to a new area without cutting, it is also called a “rapid” move. Note that the F parameter can be used here and is remembered by subsequent commands",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "ccca09641c2509c4",
    "text": "Move to the given coordinates, see above for the difference with G0. Takes the same F parameter as G0",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "0a312d759af7df49",
    "text": "Clockwise circular motion : go to point with coordinates XYZ while rotating around point with relative coordinates IJ",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "284ecbe1bcc243cf",
    "text": "Counter-clockwise motion : see above",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "25cc9eadcfff456e",
    "text": "Dwell P<seconds>",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "d231748affd3781c",
    "text": "Set workspace coordinates",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "752610ed2a230746",
    "text": "Select XYZ plane (command is modal)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "0d056b9976c3aa9f",
    "text": "Select XZY plane (command is modal)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "7840835c97916816",
    "text": "Select YZX plane (command is modal)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "3c32d431286d9cbd",
    "text": "Inch mode : passed coordinates will be considered as Inches, so internally translated to millimeters",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "9e41acc7b96d9ffa",
    "text": "Millimeter mode (",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "37a8eec1ce19687d",
    "text": "default",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "38770d4a2580bcd6",
    "text": ") : passed coordinates will be considered as millimeters",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "c1c2dd0ceba6a252",
    "text": "G28 means goto clearance position on the Carvera",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "082e5d62173fcc16",
    "text": "G32 probes the grid and turns the compensation on, this will remain in effect until reset or M370, X and Y are the start position, A and B are the width and length, I and J are the grid size, H is the height.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "bf2a3603cba642d7",
    "text": "Standard probe commands implemented as documented",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "b79020f8a166dcf1",
    "text": "Must be on a line by itself OR the first G code on a line, the directly following G0/G1 will be executed in MCS coordinates",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "aa7a175e88241c60",
    "text": "Use workspace coordinates",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "611baa8a9a07b738",
    "text": "Absolute mode (",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "ea6060ffb2df92b4",
    "text": ") (command is modal)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "2b01ccecb6cce966",
    "text": "Relative mode (command is modal)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "14ba17a42ed46e2d",
    "text": "Set global workspace coordinate system to specified coordinates",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "f8406fa8bdeeb17f",
    "text": "Clear the G92 offsets",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "b82868d11da68a86",
    "text": "Manually set homing (MCS) for XYZ",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "b33c8139abc69936",
    "text": "M Codes",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "d50432a7e1286e6c",
    "text": "Starts the spindle. The S parameter sets the speed in rotations per minute",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "51ec1cf313b397d7",
    "text": "Stops the spindle",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "132e2bf2246ce58a",
    "text": "Auto tool change,  T0 indicates wireless probe, T-1 indicates None",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "65bed0e2a6c221e8",
    "text": "Starts the airflow",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "51e114883dd3ffb9",
    "text": "Stops the airflow",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "9adc37a714fbd250",
    "text": "End of the program, no action on the Carvera",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "cecb2236eceada85",
    "text": "Read the current spindle temperature",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "c7c4cf85621e3a99",
    "text": "S<factor in percent>- set feed speed factor override percentage",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "705c7a329a14e3bb",
    "text": "S<factor in percent>- set spindle speed factor override percentage",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "39b9af87647c5e0c",
    "text": "Enter the laser mode, The machine will drop the current tool automatically and calibrate the spindle Collet (to set the laser offset to the working surface)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "1120af02d5c6ddc8",
    "text": "Exit the laser mode",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "2af60e6570fde822",
    "text": "Enter the laser test mode, the laser module will be supplied a very low power, usually used for re-focusing the laser",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "16713b0685adbe04",
    "text": "Exit the laser test mode",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "ad6fa597cedd948c",
    "text": "S<factor in percent>- set laser power factor override percentage",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "c6bad87994d49da8",
    "text": "Turn on the auto vacuum mode, if on, the vacuum will be turned on automatically when the spindle is running and turned off when the spindle is not running",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "1eca6ca7ccc7a41e",
    "text": "Turn off the auto vacuum mode",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "bdb56807ddd75804",
    "text": "Clears the auto bed levelling data and disabled the compensation until G32 is run again",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "0d03703086dadcc1",
    "text": "Display the current bed leveling grid data in the MDI window",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "021a4c1f20d12a81",
    "text": "Retrieve device MAC address",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "7f87abe53d330ff8",
    "text": "Retrieve device IP address",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "2d62b354f84b4941",
    "text": "Execute the ATC homing process, homing will be executed automatically when issuing M490.1 or M490.2 if needed",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "3321b901020c602a",
    "text": "Tightens the spindle collect to secure a new tool in the spindle",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "38d18e25f34283d8",
    "text": "Loosens the spindle collet and drops the current milling bit",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "5dd8582b2e8a1ec3",
    "text": "Execute a calibration, and the TLO (tool length offset) for the current tool will be reset",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "f1acc2075fd40cdc",
    "text": "Set the status of automatic tool change，subcode 1: Drop tool, subcode 2: Pick tool, subcode 3:Calibrate, subcode 4:margin, subcode 5:Zprobe, subcode 6: Autolevel, subcode 7: Done, subcode 0: None",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "bc71affd940cf93a",
    "text": "Pauses the machine and waits for a resume command to continue",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "26f808bb86d3a3e2",
    "text": "Turn on the internal vacuum (Carvera). The S parameter sets the power of the vacuum (S100 = 100%)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "6dce23d665d32b49",
    "text": "Turn off the internal vacuum (Carvera)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "4a1ec219a1b902ef",
    "text": "Turn on the spindle cooling fan.  The S parameter sets the power of the fan",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "29bf4143c0625e2f",
    "text": "Turn off the spindle cooling fan",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "6f199329a5853c88",
    "text": "Turn on the light",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "89124f757072d922",
    "text": "Turn off the light",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "7d520c4ce5301b9e",
    "text": "Turn on the tool detector sensor laser",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "1a996ff5e845efc9",
    "text": "Turn off the tool detector sensor laser",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "7e42907c68cc7bf1",
    "text": "Turn on the wireless probe charging power",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "24c6651b4586c22b",
    "text": "Turn off the wireless probe charging power",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "05e9319c08376027",
    "text": "Turn on the extended port power.  The S parameter sets the PWM output of the port, such as the suction power  (S50 = 50%)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "57fcfd3ad36ef1c3",
    "text": "Turn off the extended port power",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "cd73950dcdd2e503",
    "text": "Turn on the beep. (only for Carvera Air)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "8d5cfba608da3896",
    "text": "Turn off the beep. (only for Carvera Air)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "8bacd900aecd504f",
    "text": "Console Commands",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "a0b6023a990c646e",
    "text": "The smoothieware supports console commands to operating files, running jobs, monitoring status, etc. The Carvera firmware support most of them too,",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "ab0de4b998bc0c0e",
    "text": "checkout here",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "a185aacd886a1f85",
    "text": ". We have integrated them into GUI so you don't need to run manually. The below list are the ones are modified or added by the Carvera.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "713166971d730f81",
    "text": "Command",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "16ec9aa6660b6592",
    "text": "Command_Example",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "7978f506baa16285",
    "text": "ap",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "98cb656d8af085cd",
    "text": "Enable/disable or change the password for the WiFi Access Point",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "acd85906eb4edc85",
    "text": "'ap ssid xxxx' (change AP name ).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "0c124192b940ed54",
    "text": "'ap password xxxx' (set password ).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "22667c5f3221a4e3",
    "text": "'ap disable' (disable AP).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "5acc00f31bea40a6",
    "text": "'ap enable' (enable AP).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "89e448883d6895da",
    "text": "ap xxxx",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "a3cacc8283f848a0",
    "text": "goto",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "b966d6040511d3f5",
    "text": "Resume a job from a certain line.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "8d59829c1e15afe1",
    "text": "Usage",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "e6fa05269542a708",
    "text": "Open the job, and start normally.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "5a21c26aaceddd21",
    "text": "When the job begins to execute, pause it.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "eef6dbf747f424b2",
    "text": "When it is successfully paused, go to the MDI window and manually input goto XXXX",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "306d292ca3f6a1f2",
    "text": "You will see the job jump to XXXX line",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "8c0f7e59f9ec06a5",
    "text": "Hit resume and continue the job.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "4b598102b961c35c",
    "text": "Be very careful about Z height, and avoid any collisions, you can lift the Z a bit after pausing the job.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "3e958ddbef0b0b00",
    "text": "goto xxxx",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "336074805fc85398",
    "text": "time",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "df53e0e57f746755",
    "text": "Retrieve the current time of the control board, displayed in timestamp format",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "5ca4f3850ccc331a",
    "text": "version",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "b5b952aa1ee9ce15",
    "text": "Retrieve the current firmware version",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "0a443a771fa4d848",
    "text": "wlan",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "649f3a5a22b6d979",
    "text": "Connect/disconnect or scan the WiFi network.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "22f30d06cddcb8c2",
    "text": "'wlan' (scan WiFi ).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "ec7aeed1b5fe9fee",
    "text": "'wlan ssid password' (connect to a certain WiFi AP).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "9997d6e9e8d87829",
    "text": "'wlan -d' (Disconnect from WiFi AP).",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "1748a478cdf71874",
    "text": "wlan xxxx",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "3d07af5e675af33b",
    "text": "Check the functionality of the 4th axis module (harmonic drive version) on the Carvera and Carvera Air",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "8978eeb8f1383699",
    "text": "‘enable_4th’ (enable 4th axis module with harmonic drive ) - Carvera",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "2c6f4a7b0abd7208",
    "text": "‘disable_4th’ (disable 4th axis module with harmonic drive ) - Carvera",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "7f1df453e621c31c",
    "text": "‘check_4th’ (checks rotation limits of 4th axis module with harmonic drive) - Carvera & Carvera Air",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "708dd2dcb62e5dce",
    "text": "check_4th",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "d01b7ce9154ef026",
    "text": "beep",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "c3f06ffa7df4227e",
    "text": "Enable or disable the beep tone played on the Carvera Air",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "87184b63f4f5712d",
    "text": "‘config-set sd switch.beep.enable false’ (disable the tone)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "c73e211316a2a6b1",
    "text": "config-set sd switch.beep.enable true (enable the tone)",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  },
  {
    "id": "aa665e395e9b4e76",
    "text": "Reset the machine after running these commands for the change to take effect",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/supported-codes"
  }
]
